   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oPt CAP 2009 OCHA-HERF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">oPt CAP 2009 OCHA-HERF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN OCHA is UN&apos;s coordination mechanism for humanitarian support. Sida gives support to an emergency fund administrated by OCHA in the Occupied Palestinian territories (Humanitarian Emergency Response Fund - HERF). Project within the HERF is dedicated to quick emergency initiatives. The HERF mechanism ensures a quick response to immmediate needs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN OCHA &#xE4;r FNs koordineringsmeknism f&#xF6;r humanit&#xE4;rt st&#xF6;d. Sida ger st&#xF6;d till en humanit&#xE4;r fond administrerad av OCHA f&#xF6;r de ockuperade Palestinska omr&#xE5;dena, (Humanitarian Emergency Response Fund - HERF). Projekt inom HERF g&#xE5;r till snabba insatser f&#xF6;r humanit&#xE4;rt st&#xF6;d inom oPt. Mekanismen s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;ller snabbt agerande.</narrative>
  </description>
